      summer: "Hot, dry, and breezy — afternoons near 28°C, nights cooling quickly to around 12°C, and almost no rain from late June to September. The westerly wind through the Cascade gap picks up most afternoons, drying hay and laundry in an hour and fanning any spark in the grass; heat waves can push past 38°C.",
